longdesc Kblocks defines a number of commands to make drawing control
longdesc block diagrams using TikZ/PGF more structured and easier. It
longdesc reduces the learning curve forTikZ/PGF and serves as a
longdesc frontend, by focusing on the block resp. flow diagrams only.
